{{#if productLogoUrl}}<img src="{{productLogoUrl}}" height="32" alt="{{productName}}" style="display:block;height:32px;width:auto;max-width:180px;border:0;margin:0 0 20px 0;">{{/if}}
<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;color:#0A0A0A;">Rinnovo in arrivo</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">Il contratto <strong style="font-weight:600;">{{contractCode}}</strong> di {{companyName}} su {{productName}} si rinnova il <strong style="font-weight:600;">{{renewalDate}}</strong>{{#if renewalAmount}} per {{renewalAmount}} più IVA{{/if}}.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 0 0;">Se non volete rinnovarlo, la disdetta va chiesta a Keus entro i termini di preavviso del contratto.</p>
